{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S05、S07、S13等短停留段的信息仍偏密，少数感受词如“对生命的眷恋”“久别重逢”显得额外加戏，容易分散注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙述拆成短句，用加亮关键词让观众不必逐字阅读也能抓住每段心理变化；感受缩小并按音乐时机出现，也更适合边听边看。反复出现的船、水、摇荡意象和结尾对开头的回应，让整段情绪有连续的回环。Y的完整句子在交代人物动机、行为原因和心理因果方面更自然充分，这是X相对损失的一点，但综合观看体验仍是X更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1e9731c6-8465-41ed-bf14-9346d34eb910", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T194822044652Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:50:13.050563+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a6ad6c79400ec228b528c7d4621d5352b9480a0f25cb5c408325e5a4364715c9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "e